---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import michel from '../../assets/photos/michel-e1456686054610.jpg';
import jcc from '../../assets/photos/jc-cuvelier.jpg';
---
<section id="curators" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 112px 32px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(380px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 56px 80px; align-items: start">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent)"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--accent); display: inline-block"></span>The curators</div>
<h2 style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(34px, 3.6vw, 52px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance; color: #F3F5F7">Kept alive by two people who keep showing up.</h2>
<p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #A3ACB9; margin: 0; max-width: 480px; text-wrap: pretty">Hackathon Belgium is curated by Michel and Jean-Christophe, who organise, facilitate and attend hackathons across the country. Spotted an event we missed? Tell them.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 28px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #A3ACB9">
<span><span style="color: #F3F5F7">Since 2011</span></span>
<span><span style="color: #F3F5F7">150+</span> hackathons tracked</span>
<span><span style="color: #F3F5F7">20</span> cities</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<div style="background: #12161D; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start">
<Image src={michel} alt="Michel Duchateau" width={192} height={192} loading="lazy" style="width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 16px; object-fit: cover; flex: 0 0 auto" />
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; flex: 1 1 220px; min-width: 0">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<h3 style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-weight: 600; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; color: #F3F5F7">Michel Duchateau</h3>
<p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #A3ACB9; margin: 0">Global Facilitator, Startup Weekend · Chief Innovation Officer at Convidencia</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px">
<a href="http://www.convidencia.com" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); color: #F3F5F7; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Website</a>
<a href="https://x.com/miduchateau" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); color: #F3F5F7; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">X</a>
<a href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/mduchateau" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); color: #F3F5F7; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">LinkedIn</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="background: #12161D; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start">
<Image src={jcc} alt="Jean-Christophe Cuvelier" width={192} height={192} loading="lazy" style="width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 16px; object-fit: cover; flex: 0 0 auto" />
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; flex: 1 1 220px; min-width: 0">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<h3 style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-weight: 600; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; color: #F3F5F7">Jean-Christophe Cuvelier</h3>
<p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #A3ACB9; margin: 0">Forward-deployed product engineer and founder. I embed in your team, ship AI in production, and leave you software you own and a team that keeps shipping.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px">
<a href="https://wellmade.be/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); color: #F3F5F7; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Wellmade</a>
<a href="https://totophe.com/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); color: #F3F5F7; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Website</a>
<a href="https://x.com/totophe" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); color: #F3F5F7; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">X</a>
<a href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/totophe" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); color: #F3F5F7; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">LinkedIn</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
